fd5452dd081fd8c970a174d5ffad7b7686310b451dd807a006fbb870852d","download_count":593,"created_at":"2026-09-30T13:27:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T13:27:44Z"},{"id":600957434,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84j0eH6","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:b204d117e3d369ca71dc149c29ba6f3f4e41ba45e07fbec3859aa2325b7cbfa4","download_count":2194,"created_at":"2026-09-30T13:11:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T13:11:57Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 统一 Studio 导航栏、页面标题和列表操作，优化移动端布局。\n- 统一页面加载反馈，改进 Logo 加载动画及减少动态效果模式下的可见性。\n- 优化自定义背景和毛玻璃层次，修复窗口边缘与圆角衔接，让麦克风按钮跟随主题配色。\n- 按平台调整桌面窗口控制按钮的位置与样式，保留 Windows 原生窗口圆角。\n- Gateway 自动启动改为显式开启，Profile 列表加载不再等待 CLI 检查，并修复消息气泡首次渲染。\n- 用量统计新增费用记录与自定义模型单价，支持本地模型目录估算费用，改进模型上下文限制匹配。\n- 修复 Agent 管理器中 Cursor 图标在浅色卡片上的显示。\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cursor): use the product logo on Agent Manager cards by @KK-Skyline in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3222\n* [codex] record usage costs and refresh local model pricing and limits by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3226\n* [codex] unify Studio navigation, headers and mobile layouts by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3232\n* [codex] make Gateway startup opt-in and unblock page initialization by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3233\n* [codex] position desktop window controls by platform by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3234\n* [codex] refine desktop window control placement and styling by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3235\n* [codex] fix desktop theme surfaces, controls, and loading feedback by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3236\n* chore: bump Studio and desktop to 0.7.26 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3237\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.25...v0.7.26\n","mentions_count":2}
